 "limits": "Timestamps are YYYY-MM-DD dates or ISO 8601 date-times; offsets are converted to UTC before slots are counted, so local midnight can shift a record to another day. One record per slot counts as covered; the helper does not check how many records a slot should have. Sequence values must be integers; other values are skipped.",
